# On-prem server files get copied from workstation — we do NOT commit the live
# on-prem server's .env, MySQL dump imports, TLS keys, or local PKI private
# key (Root CA private key MUST stay OFF git, ideally encrypted in a vault).
# The PUBLIC root certs (DMS-RootCA.pem/.crt/.p7b) can safely be committed if
# you want them; the .gitkeep just makes sure the folder exists in git.
*.sql
*.sql.gz
!.gitkeep
